9. PR.AXIS_RECTANGULARITY - Measures area efficiency within the primary-axis rectangle.
10. MAX.LENGTH_RECTANGULARITY - Calculates area efficiency within maximum length-derived rectangles.
11. SCALED_VARIANCE_ALONG_MAJOR_AXIS - Captures spread along the minor axis.
12. SCALED_VARIANCE_ALONG_MINOR_AXIS - Captures spread along the major axis.
13. SCALED_RADIUS_OF_GYRATION - Represents variance concentration of mass (mavar + mivar / area).
14. SKEWNESS_ABOUT_MAJOR_AXIS - Indicates asymmetry about the major axis.
15. SKEWNESS_ABOUT_MINOR_AXIS - Indicates asymmetry about the minor axis.
16. KURTOSIS_ABOUT_MINOR_AXIS - Measures tail shapes relative to major-axis distributions.
17. KURTOSIS_ABOUT_MAJOR_AXIS - Measures tail shapes relative to minor-axis distributions.
18. HOLLOWS_RATIO - Quantifies hollows relative to bounding polygons.

These features cover essential aspects of geometric compactness, symmetry, proportional relationships, and distribution across axes, making them effective for vehicle type differentiation.
